# DESK47 run A -- double-click C:\D47\CMDLINE.NTP from our own desktop.
#
# The window C:\D47\ is opened by method/newdesk-d47.inf (#W 02 04 26 0C), the
# same geometry DESK46 used for C:\D46\, so its single file sits at the same
# icon centre (64,124) -- measured in measurement-2026-09-26-desk43-u3
# (screendumps/locate-desktop.png) and re-confirmed by this run's own A_IDLE
# screendump.
#
# Keys are raw IKBD bytes (make, then break = make|0x80).  h=23 e=12 l=26
# o=18, Return=1C -- kernel/src/keymap.rs US_NORM: index 0x23 -> 0x68 'h',
# 0x12 -> 0x65 'e', 0x26 -> 0x6C 'l', 0x18 -> 0x6F 'o', 0x1C -> 0x0D CR.
100 parkbr
600 mark A_IDLE
900 move 64 124
1100 mark B_ON_ICON
1300 down
1303 up
1308 down
1311 up
1500 mark C_CLICKED
2500 mark D_DIALOG
2600 key 23
2620 key A3
2640 key 12
2660 key 92
2680 key 26
2700 key A6
2720 key 26
2740 key A6
2760 key 18
2780 key 98
3000 mark E_TYPED
3200 key 1C
3220 key 9C
3400 mark F_OK
